---
description: RDE domain adapter pointer
globs: src/rde_domains/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow the library contracts in `src/rde/docs/methodology.md`,
`src/rde/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `src/rde/docs/engineering.md`, and
`src/rde/docs/experiment-playbook.md`. HSP and TSP code is an `rde.domains`
plugin; core RDE must remain adapter-independent.

Each domain's access model, predictors, targets, and held-out families live
in its `DomainContract` (`src/rde_domains/contracts.py`), not a separate
charter document.
